    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d488">

                <pb facs="0724" n="710" sameAs="frus:frus1947v05/pg710"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">880.00/9–2347: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-09-23T12:00:00+01:00">September 23,
                            1947—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4118. With reference to my several telegrams concerning my talks with the French
                    on subject of North African situation I have now received from Chauvel a
                    complete Foreign Office folder (including memorandum and 25 detailed appendices)
                    on French policy concerning Moroccan and Tunisian protectorates.</p>
                <p>I consider that the information contained in these papers is on the whole most
                    encouraging and generally in line with the recommendations of North African
                    meeting held Paris June 16–19, 1947.</p>
                <p>Detailed analysis going forward by airmail despatch<anchor n="1" xml:id="d488-f1"
                    /> within 4 hours and full report<anchor n="2" xml:id="d488-f2"/> as soon as
                    possible thereafter.</p>
                <p>Sent Department 4118, repeated Tangier 38, Rabat 19, Tunis 23, Algiers 71.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
